1
00:00:00,193 --> 00:00:02,833
Stop it. Stop celebrating me!

2
00:00:03,463 --> 00:00:04,733
(Voice:)Woo!

3
00:00:04,831 --> 00:00:06,901
And no woos!

4
00:00:07,066 --> 00:00:08,336
Not you, Dr. Woo, you're fins.

5
00:00:12,872 --> 00:00:15,982
(Sheldon:)I want you all to know that
you have no reason to applaud me.

6
00:00:16,142 --> 00:00:19,752
(Sheldon:)My so-called breakthrough
wasn't the result of my genius.

7
00:00:19,913 --> 00:00:22,253
(Sheldon:)It was nothing more
than a boneheaded mistake.

8
00:00:22,415 --> 00:00:26,025
(Sheldon:)So please refrain from praising me
for it in the future.

9
00:00:26,586 --> 00:00:28,366
(Raj:)I don't understand.
They didn't End the element?

10
00:00:28,521 --> 00:00:30,501
(Sheldon:)No, they found the element.

11
00:00:30,590 --> 00:00:33,040
No, no, stop it!

12
00:00:33,193 --> 00:00:35,263
(Sheldon:)I don't need to take this admiration
from the likes of you people!

13
00:00:37,564 --> 00:00:40,914
(Sheldon:)-How do I make them stop loving me?
-Invite them to live with us.

14
00:00:45,038 --> 00:00:47,078
(Penny:)Boy, Bernadette is gonna love this.

15
00:00:47,240 --> 00:00:51,120
(Leonard:)It must be nice to have someone
do something so romantic.

16
00:00:51,945 --> 00:00:53,445
(Penny:)Okay, you know what's not romantic?

17
00:00:53,613 --> 00:00:55,023
(Penny:)Rubbing it in someone's face.

18
00:00:55,181 --> 00:01:01,021
(Leonard:)Actually, it can be,
but I told you sex doesn't count.

